    "The app will open when loading is finished.": "应用程序在充电完成后将打开。",
    "The backup adds recovery profiles. Your current profiles and settings stay as they are.": "备份添加恢复资料. 您的当前资料和设置保持如同。",
    "The backup operation failed. Try again.": "备份操作失败了,再试一次。",
    "The cached update expired and must be downloaded again": "已关闭的更新,必须重新下载",
    "The channel could not be resolved again.": "这个频道再也无法解决。",
    "The connection did not recover in time. Complete saved segments were kept.": "连接没有及时恢复,完全保存的部分被保留。",
    "The connection to the provider was interrupted. Check your internet connection and try again. If it keeps happening, contact your provider.": "连接到供应商已被中断. 检查您的互联网连接并尝试一次. 如果它继续发生,请联系您的供应商。",
    "The connection to the source was refused. Check the source address, HTTP/HTTPS protocol and port, or try another network.": "请检查源地址、HTTP/HTTPS协议和端口,或者尝试另一个网络。",
    "The connection to the stream was lost. Automatic reconnection failed. Check your connection and try again.": "连接到流失去了. 自动重新连接失败了. 检查您的连接并尝试一次。",
    "The deepest buffer available. Uses noticeably more memory, and it still cannot help a connection that never gets ahead, or a provider that drops the stream on a timer.": "使用显著更多的内存,它仍然无法帮助一个连接,从未走进,或一个提供商,将流量降在一个时间表。",
    "The detected usage may be out of date. If the provider limit is unknown, TVBro assumes one stream.": "发现的使用可能已退出日期. 如果供应商限制不明,TVBro 将采取一个流。",
    "The latest panel state will then be pulled.": "最后的板块状态将被撤回。",
    "The local buffer is not ready yet.": "目前,本地布局尚未准备好。",
    "The local buffer limit was reached while playback still needed its files. Return to live or increase the limit.": "當地的泡沫限制達到,而播放仍然需要其檔案。",
    "The name comes from this device. You can change it.": "这个名字来自这个设备,你可以改变它。",
    "The new copy will not use end-to-end encryption. The panel server will be able to read its playlist credentials. The original encrypted profile stays unchanged.": "新版本将不使用终端加密,面板服务器将能够阅读其播放列表的认证,原始加密的个人资料将保持不变。",
    "The oldest buffer expired; moved to the saved window.": "最古老的泡沫已经消失了;移动到保存的窗口。",
    "The panel's own guide (xmltv.php)": "面板的自己的指南(xmltv.php)",
    "The player closed before local playback started.": "玩家在本地播放开始之前关闭。",
    "The playlist's own url-tvg guide, if it has one": "播放列表的自己的URL-TVG指南,如果它有一个",
    "The portal's own guide": "门户的自己的指南",
    "The provider HLS playlist contains a media gap.": "提供商 HLS 播放列表包含一个媒体差距。",
    "The provider address could not be found (DNS). Check your internet connection and the source address, then try again.": "提供商地址无法找到(DNS)。检查您的互联网连接和源地址,然后再试一次。",
    "The provider changed its HLS playlist format.": "供应商改变了其HLS播放列表格式。",
    "The provider changed its HLS target duration while recording.": "供应商在录制时改变了其HLS目标时间。",
    "The provider could not be reached. Check your internet connection and source address, then try again.": "您可以查看您的互联网连接和源地址,然后再试一次。",
    "The provider could not find the requested data (HTTP {status}). Try again; if the error persists, check the source URL.": "提供商无法找到所需的数据(HTTP {status} ) 再次尝试;如果错误仍然存在,请检查源 URL。",
    "The provider denied access (HTTP {status}). Check that your subscription is active and this device or network is allowed, or contact your provider.": "供应商拒绝访问(HTTP {status} ) 请确保您的订阅已活跃,该设备或网络已允许,或者联系您的供应商。",
    "The provider did not respond in time (HTTP {status}). Try again shortly; its server may be busy or unavailable.": "提供商没有及时回复(HTTP {status} ) 再试一次,很短一段时间;服务器可能忙碌或不可用。",
    "The provider did not respond in time. Check your internet connection and try again. Its server may be busy or unavailable.": "服务提供商没有及时回复,检查您的互联网连接并尝试一次,服务器可能忙碌或不适用。",
    "The provider did not return an HLS playlist.": "供应商没有返回HLS播放列表。",
    "The provider has no such address (HTTP {status}). Check the URL in the source details.": "提供商没有这样的地址(HTTP {status} ) 查看源详细信息中的URL。",
    "The provider is rate-limiting this device (HTTP {status}). Wait a moment and try again.": "提供商正在限制这个设备的利率(HTTP {status} )等一会儿,再试一次。",
    "The provider media redirect could not be followed.": "提供商媒体转向无法跟踪。",
    "The provider media redirect is invalid.": "提供商媒体转向是无效的。",
    "The provider must allow TVBro to connect from this app. Ask them to enable access for TVBro.": "提供商必须允许TVBro从该应用程序连接,请他们允许TVBro访问。",
    "The provider redirected to an unsupported media URL.": "提供商转向未支持的媒体URL。",
    "The provider redirected too many times.": "供应商过度重定向。",
    "The provider refused this request (HTTP {status}). That came from their server, not your settings — try again shortly.": "提供商拒绝了这个请求(HTTP {status} ) ,这是从他们的服务器,而不是你的设置 - 再试一次很快。",
    "The provider rejected these credentials (HTTP {status}). Check the source details.": "供应商拒绝了这些认证(HTTP {status})。",
    "The provider returned a different HLS byte range.": "供应商返回了不同的HLS比特范围。",
    "The provider returned an invalid response. Check that the source address and type are correct. If they are correct, try again later or contact your provider.": "供应商返回了不正确的回复,请确保源地址和类型是正确的,如果它们是正确的,请稍后再试一次或联系您的供应商。",
    "The provider server is temporarily unavailable (HTTP {status}). Try again shortly. If the problem persists, contact your provider.": "提供商服务器暂时无法使用(HTTP {status} ). 再试一次,如果问题持续下去,请联系您的提供商。",
    "The provider stopped sending media in time.": "该公司停止及时发送媒体。",
    "The provider stream limit ({limit}) is in use. Stop another stream or recording.": "提供商流量限制({limit})已使用,停止其他流或录制。",
