    "This clears external metadata and restores cached movie/series display fields from source-provided data where possible.": "此清除外部的数据,并在可能的情况下从源提供的数据中恢复隐藏的电影/系列显示字段。",
    "This device could not decode the stream. Try another channel or playback engine.": "此裝置無法解密流程. 試試另一個渠道或播放引擎。",
    "This device is paired": "该设备已被包装",
    "This device will appear as \"{name}\". You can give it another name in the panel.": "此裝置將以「{name}」的名稱顯示。",
    "This episode is locked. Return to the library to unlock protected content.": "此集被锁定 返回图书馆,以解锁保护内容。",
    "This feature requires existing Supporter access. Pair your account and assign an existing place to this device, then refresh access.": "此功能需要现有支持者访问,并将您的帐户分配到该设备的现有位置,然后更新访问。",
    "This panel profile has no playlists. Choose another profile or add a playlist in the panel.": "此面板配置文件没有播放列表. 选择另一个配置文件或在面板中添加播放列表。",
    "This playlist URL looks like an Xtream panel. As an Xtream source it also gives Movies, Series and the subscription expiry, which a playlist can’t carry.": "此播放列表 URL 看起来像一个 Xtream 面板. 作为一个 Xtream 来源,它也提供电影,系列和订阅的终止,播放列表不能携带。",
    "This profile changed on the panel since this device last synced. Pushing will replace those newer changes.": "此配置文件已在该设备上最后同步后更改,按钮将取代这些更新的更改。",
    "This profile has no usable playlists.": "此配置文件没有可用的播放列表。",
    "This profile is end-to-end encrypted. Open the panel and unlock it to finish setting up this device.": "此配置文件是终端加密的. 打开面板并打开它完成设置该设备。",
    "This profile is end-to-end encrypted. Open the panel and unlock it to finish setting up this device. Until then, Push is disabled and sources without saved credentials need attention.": "此配置文件是终端加密. 打开面板并打开它完成设置该设备. 到那时, Push 已被禁用,没有保存的身份证的来源需要注意。",
    "This profile was end-to-end encrypted, but the server now reports it as off (or at an older key). Nothing is being sent in the clear. Open the panel and verify this profile's Security settings.": "此个人资料已被终端加密,但服务器现在报告它如外(或在更老的键)。 没有什么在清晰中发送。",
    "This profile’s PIN was set by a newer version of the app. Update to open it.": "此配置文件的 PIN 已由应用程序的新版本设置,更新以打开。",
    "This provider uses HTTP. This TV version needs HTTPS. Ask your provider for an HTTPS address or use TVBro on Android, Windows or Samsung.": "此提供商使用 HTTP. 此电视版本需要 HTTPS. 请求您的提供商找到 HTTPS 地址或在 Android、Windows 或 Samsung 上使用 TVBro。",
    "This recording has no playable saved media yet.": "此录制还没有播放可保存的媒体。",
