    "This replaces the current sources, profiles, settings, favorites and viewing history with the backup. Cloud profiles are restored locally; select or pair a cloud profile to resume sync.": "此将取代当前的来源、个人资料、设置、喜欢和查看历史,备份。云资料将本地恢复;选择或结合云资料以重新同步。",
    "This replaces the source list, metadata settings, and favorites of the selected profile ({profile}) with the ones on this device. Anything in that profile that isn't on this device will be removed.": "此取代源列表、甲数据设置和所选的个人资料({profile})的偏好,并将此设备上的任何内容删除。",
